Jiang Fei knocked Chen Yun's body away again, and a feeling of weakness surged into his heart;
He was attacked by a sneak attack and suffered some injuries.
He also doesn’t have any martial arts skills to deal with weird things.
I'm going to die here, Jiang Fei thought;
But everything he did would not lead to a meaningless death.
If she could delay this weirdness for a while, she would have killed so many fewer people;
He couldn't control whether these people would die sooner or later.
A familiar figure appeared in front of him and leaned towards him. It was his little green plum;
Jiang Fei had no expression on his face and struck with his sword again.
This one doesn’t have many weird attack methods;
Illusions, direct mental attacks, controlling the attached body to perform physical attacks
Among them, due to environmental reasons, illusion does not work very well;
Because there are only herself and her here, how could someone close to her suddenly appear here?
Physical attacks are not very effective. Although Weird controls Chen Yun's body, it does not have her memory, let alone the martial arts she has mastered;
What it relies on is just the powerful desire of the Four Realm warriors themselves and the energy in their bodies.
The most troublesome thing is the mental attack!
Jiang Fei didn't know what level this weirdo was, but he thought it should be the fourth realm;
My head is now feeling pain like pinpricks, and even my vision is a little blurry.
But actually this is not the most important thing;
The most terrible thing is that if this strange thing abandons Chen Yun's body and chooses him as the possessed object, Jiang Fei really has no confidence that he can resist it.
In the midst of suffering, Jiang Fei saw Chu Yuan, who had left earlier, running towards him;
He turned around skillfully and struck down with his sword!
"Fuck!"
Chu Yuan rarely cursed, but he couldn't help but curse at this time;
A sword beam came towards him like a shooting star, making his scalp numb for a while!
He had no intention of resisting at all, and urged Luo Yanbu to dodge with all his strength;
The sword passed by, taking away a piece of flesh from the waist, and then shot into the building behind.
As the house collapsed, red blood flowed from Chu Yuan's waist.
He had not been injured in his previous fight with the murderer who pretended to be him, and even in his fight with this weirdo, he only received a slight shock in his body;
I didn’t expect that the first substantial injury I suffered was caused by a ‘teammate’
Seeing him bleeding, Jiang Fei immediately realized that he had chopped the wrong person. This was not an illusion created by Weirdness;
Before he could apologize, Jiang Fei kept saying, "Why are you back again!?"
"I'll come back to save you!" Chu Yuan replied with burning pain in his waist while controlling the spiritual power in his body to stop the bleeding.
"Go quickly, I can hold her for a while."
"Stop talking nonsense." Chu Yuan casually pulled a rag from his upper body and wrapped it around the wound on his waist;
His shirt was almost torn in the previous fight with Weiyi, and he was struck by Jiang Fei with a sword, completely ending his life.
Chen Yun's figure appeared again, floating not far from Chu Yuan;
Her dark pupils showed no emotion, but Chu Yuan could feel that she was staring straight at his wound;
Chu Yuan could even feel the greedy and eager emotions emanating from her!
I have never heard that Weiyi likes human souls, but I have never heard that Weiyi likes the flesh and blood of humans. Chu Yuan's heart moved. Could it be that spiritual power can not only hurt her, but also be a great tonic for her?
In order to confirm his thoughts, Chu Yuan threw the cloth stained with his own blood at her;
But she dodged, caught it in her hand, and swallowed it whole.
